1
00:00:00,055 --> 00:00:03,287
EthioEMR is one platform with three parts:

2
00:00:03,287 --> 00:00:09,289
the team's EMR, Form Studio for building
forms, and an AI assistant inside the

3
00:00:09,289 --> 00:00:09,751
chart.

4
00:00:10,264 --> 00:00:11,743
First, Form Studio.

5
00:00:11,743 --> 00:00:16,336
It opens from the app menu and lists
every form in the EMR.

6
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:23,652
Here is the gynecology triage form in the
editor, next to a live preview.

7
00:00:25,366 --> 00:00:27,652
Rules are written in plain words.

8
00:00:27,652 --> 00:00:30,838
PV is shown only when Vaginal Bleeding is Yes.

9
00:00:35,027 --> 00:00:37,339
The preview follows the rule.

10
00:00:37,339 --> 00:00:39,491
Choose Yes, and PV appears.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,046
The Check looks up every
concept on the server.

12
00:00:43,046 --> 00:00:45,832
Zero errors, so the form can be downloaded.

13
00:00:47,816 --> 00:00:49,417
Now the AI assistant.

14
00:00:49,417 --> 00:00:55,517
It retrieves passages from Ethiopian and WHO
guidelines, answers only from those

15
00:00:55,517 --> 00:00:57,728
passages, and cites each one.

16
00:00:58,242 --> 00:01:04,262
In Help and Search, a clinician asks for the
danger signs of severe malaria, then

17
00:01:04,262 --> 00:01:05,154
presses Ask.

18
00:01:10,806 --> 00:01:14,385
The answer lists the danger signs
and names its sources:

19
00:01:14,385 --> 00:01:16,110
the guideline and the page.

20
00:01:19,631 --> 00:01:22,827
On a patient's chart, the Diagnosis Assistant.

21
00:01:22,827 --> 00:01:27,551
The clinician presses Speak and records
the consultation in Amharic.

22
00:01:50,057 --> 00:01:55,448
A speech model on this machine writes down
what was said, in Amharic script.

23
00:01:55,448 --> 00:01:56,512
It transcribes.

24
00:01:56,512 --> 00:01:58,073
It does not translate.

25
00:01:58,573 --> 00:02:03,445
One click sends the complaint and the
patient's recent vitals to the assistant.

26
00:02:06,955 --> 00:02:12,116
Back comes a ranked differential, built from
the transcript, the vitals and the

27
00:02:12,116 --> 00:02:12,835
guidelines.

28
00:02:13,336 --> 00:02:17,512
Each item links to the chart record or
guideline page behind it.

29
00:02:17,512 --> 00:02:19,600
Nothing is written to the chart.

30
00:02:20,186 --> 00:02:21,214
One platform:

31
00:02:21,214 --> 00:02:26,906
the team's EMR, Form Studio, and an AI
assistant that cites its sources.

